        "Description": "Good day 47,\rCheck these target out. because they are in a hotel. That&apos;s what you do when you leave a hotel, but these targets will be leaving in body bags. Similar to how the sheets are moved out i suppose. In bags. Maybe they have some plastic ones. Hope you don&apos;t leave too big a mess for housekeeping. Maybe remember your &quot;do not disturb&quot; doorhandle sign. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare",
